From 948c92cc47bed1440a85e801fb8286b7020f5a8b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Fxzx micah <48860358+fxzxmicah@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 22:58:53 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] disks: Use optional encryption interfaces

Use the independent UDisks encryption bindings for device relationships and
passphrase operations. Offer encryption only when the backend is available.

Create encrypted filesystems by opening a new encrypted container first and
formatting its returned cleartext device through the ordinary block API.
